# Raw levies: fire too early, hug cover, break when it goes badly.
drill "Militia"
about "Fire too early, hug cover, break when it goes badly."
type Runner
dials aggression 0.30 discipline 0.20 cohesion 0.40 cover 0.60 patience 0.15 nerve 0.25

sergeant:
  otherwise -> fire at will

man:
  when loaded and enemy within 70 -> fire
  otherwise -> follow sergeant
